# ============================================================
# ROLE: Husky commit-msg hook: delegates to agent-harness
# DEPENDS ON: @aimha/agent-harness (devDependency), husky
# USED BY: git, through core.hooksPath .husky/_ set by husky on npm install
# KEY DECISIONS: one line on purpose: the checks live in the package and change with its version
# GOTCHAS: generated by agent-harness sync, do not edit. Skippable with --no-verify: CI is the gate
# LAST UPDATED: 2026-10-22 - first version
# ============================================================

npx --no -- agent-harness hook commit-msg "$1"
